<div id="u-credit-00406-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608089148" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600877322 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">23 Sep 2020 16:08</span></p>
